      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Cluster extensions, including the observability and user management extensions, have been available since November 2026 in all the regions where Amazon SageMaker HyperPod is supported, and the other improvements in this post were announced earlier in 2026, with each announceme…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-managed-cluster-extensions-for-observability-and-user-management-in-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-slurm/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
